MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=5
RELEASE_VERSION=0
RELEASE_DATE=2026-09-14
DESCRIPTION=Add a fail-closed x86-64 freestanding BIOS boot candidate with long-mode entry, lab identity, concurrent sessions, keyboard, VGA first-cell validation, packaged-lab and portfolio-iframe Chromium tests, and a main-only GitHub Pages deploy of the validated static lab. The guest is not the hosted ELF: filesystem, networking, and server remain unavailable. Browser VGA certification waits for the diagnostic cell after Power Off/Boot, ignores SeaBIOS frames so Ready cannot race a stale hidden placeholder, and serializes QEMU pmemsave dumps. Headered children boot on the first framed visit; GitHub Pages isolation is a top-level service-worker visit then iframe, because a COEP parent blocks the first headerless document.
